  "details": "I am as blind as a bat in vr; Giving the camera a resize option so not only would the buttons be bigger, but the screen as well would help greatly for those who cant bring the camera close enough (be it headsets or mobility issues, whatever), or lean forward enough to be close (again headsets, play space, mobility, etc). \n\nNot only would it be useful for those who cant see in general due to poorer headsets, it would also help those streaming from accidentally missclicking what they wanted (ive done it plenty of times and almost crash haha).",
